{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"510234","name":"琳妮特【彩蛋】","desc":"琳妮特彩蛋","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/10/83684823/9a0a3050131f2e4d6e787604fde9641f_4736387665962482269.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基本信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/10/83684823/e0d3c9e29982da4a453f5561eb14fb67_5866064947751125557.png\",\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e琳妮特\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色名\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e2月2日\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"生日\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e布法蒂公馆\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"所属\"}],\"extra_attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e寡言少语，罕有表情的魔术助手，性情像猫一样难以猜测。\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色介绍\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8151","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/10/83684823/1885a1fcd854524e53f8ecbf9a2f50cd_5489701416234046242.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8155","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8174","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"默认标题\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8175","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"contents\":{\"2xjocicka1T1763607788065\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：别这么自豪地说出这种话啊！\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"2yr7fmxungfT1763607613038\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：你这是在…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"3n3o9mji05qT1763607612008\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：啊…欸？你、你好…\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"67x83qalq5aT1763607767005\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：总觉得应该是菲米尼出现在这里…\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e琳妮特：但他只会把机器修好，不知道怎么修坏。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e琳妮特：我可以。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"d9edi9s930eT1757454317683\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"f4zuw4mkkgqT1763607788890\":{\"option\":\"旅行者： 「修坏」这个词不对吧我说…\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"nwjwwdj9yaT1763607554428\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：哪里好了啊！\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e琳妮特：你好。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"qj8knscy6pcT1763607638180\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e琳妮特：我正在帮灰河的大家解决麻烦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e琳妮特：最近灰河里收到了几台废弃的机械，本来大家打算和之前一样，把它拆成零件之后卖掉换钱。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e琳妮特：但这台机器不知道为什么，总是无法正常停机。而且总是会在半夜莫名其妙地突然启动。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e琳妮特：机器们嘎吱嘎吱地乱跑，把好几个半夜出门或回家的人吓得半死，还有人被吓得摔进水里，淹了个半死。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e琳妮特：哥哥刚好来这边做魔术表演，就答应帮忙想想办法。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"zuqvl95br1sT1763607947964\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e琳妮特：总之，哥哥拜托我过来帮忙了，等会他会买蛋糕回来。一台机器，一份蛋糕。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e琳妮特：嗯，接下来还要再修理三台，我要先去忙了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e琳妮特：下一台的奖励蛋糕是树莓…嗯，树莓果酱夹心，浇酸糖酱，手指饼干衬底…还有薄荷巧克力装饰。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}},\"root_id\":\"d9edi9s930eT1757454317683\",\"child_ids\":{\"d9edi9s930eT1757454317683\":[]}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8176","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"名称\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"上线时间\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"相关奖励\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8177","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"地图展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"地图展示\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8178","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"dc2wos120a6T1757454317693\",\"child_ids\":{\"dc2wos120a6T1757454317693\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8179","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"七圣召唤对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"3bt5gopqd6wT1757454317710\",\"child_ids\":{\"3bt5gopqd6wT1757454317710\":[]},\"contents\":{\"3bt5gopqd6wT1757454317710\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8180","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"幻想真境剧诗对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"t12japc083T1757454317713\",\"child_ids\":{\"t12japc083T1757454317713\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8181","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"生日","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"timeline_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"生日惊喜…——2024-02-02\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e前略。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e林尼和我的生日到了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e前年他准备的「惊喜」是在蛋糕里藏了礼物，去年是让罗瑟兰叼着彩旗从帽子里蹦出来…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我的礼物就普通多了，反正不管花多少能量去准备，都会被他猜到…就像我能猜到他的计划一样。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e但他好像一直乐此不疲的样子，就随他去吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e今年我本想直接邀请你来，但总觉得林尼那边大概率还会拜托你一堆麻烦事…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e如果真变成这样，能请你配合一下他吗？我会尽量装作不知情的。\u003cbr\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"6974\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/12/13/24077343/9a4747651b96d2f6f009af9a1f2c646b_6123749959298195475.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"虹彩蔷薇\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"10\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/6974/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/6974/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e虹彩蔷薇\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*10\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"7072\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/3baf4743643438c92db7483ba9d6c01b_1141222144263362308.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"午后闲茶\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/7072/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/7072/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e午后闲茶\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/11/294074726/806741c9f2af3e9f9d8179b58cdeebf0_8698560765648608598.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/11/294074726/806741c9f2af3e9f9d8179b58cdeebf0_8698560765648608598.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/48667610\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e琳妮特生日快乐｜天气很晴朗，正适合进行露天魔术表演。\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]},{\"tab_name\":\"哈哈。哈。——2025-02-02\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e蹑手蹑脚踩在地毯上的声音很轻，但能传到我耳朵里。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e今天早餐时，林尼和菲米尼的袖口都印有不同颜色的油墨，鞋面也沾了彩纸碎屑，可以推断昨晚就是他俩在「秘密」布置场地。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我的任务就是保守秘密，当没看见。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e「哈哈哈」。但我打算比平常多笑一声。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e应该够了，即使不出声，林尼也能读懂我的心情。还是一边泡茶一边进入待机模式适合我。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e家人们都有自己的专属杯子，我也给你准备了一个，来看看喜不喜欢吧。\u003cbr\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"7008\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/08/15/183046623/5b7e13094bf43fd05b306d8072c06237_4418107913226400638.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"帝皇的决断\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/7008/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/7008/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e帝皇的决断\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"7072\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/3baf4743643438c92db7483ba9d6c01b_1141222144263362308.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"午后闲茶\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/7072/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/7072/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e午后闲茶\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/11/294074726/02c905b2a906d022c1377f1f8f0de93c_3093554880720090014.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/11/294074726/02c905b2a906d022c1377f1f8f0de93c_3093554880720090014.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/61653012\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e琳妮特生日快乐｜我明白了，是一个名为「家人」的魔术。\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]},{\"tab_name\":\"我知道。——2026-02-02\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e林尼以为我不知道。但工坊里那些魔术道具的数量和摆放位置，我记得很清楚，所以，我已经发现了那些多出来的轴承和螺丝，还有道具上新增的刮擦痕迹。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e但我很擅长保守秘密，甚至也很擅长保守「我在保守秘密」这个秘密。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e所以，我并没有告诉他这些事。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e以及，这是我为了魔术表演新学的绕口令，用这种方法可以很快吸引住客人的注意力——看，面无表情成为了一种优势。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e如果你想学快速念诵绕口令的诀窍的话，我可以教你。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e但练绕口令很容易口干，你先喝点茶吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e等林尼来了，我们一起去念绕口令给他听。这是他今年的生日礼物。\u003cbr\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"6975\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/08/15/183046623/556c64127ca7ff589cc2552e27a08cae_8214425667987841604.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"柔灯铃\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"10\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/6975/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/6975/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e柔灯铃\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*10\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"7072\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/3baf4743643438c92db7483ba9d6c01b_1141222144263362308.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"午后闲茶\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/7072/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/7072/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e午后闲茶\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/10/50494840/619221ce08219151364c7d2c419d2d50_5189744373663082085.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/10/50494840/619221ce08219151364c7d2c419d2d50_5189744373663082085.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/72868694\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e琳妮特生日快乐 | 噔噔，欢迎你来看今天的演出。\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8182","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色洞天对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"g81idlyq8zT1757454317697\",\"child_ids\":{\"3xsgaehhl0cT1757454626150\":[],\"53hupyo2ancT1757454543574\":[],\"9g2tcjhhi45T1757454652205\":[\"rslzzylh19T1757454659676\"],\"g7gliaewevT1757454507355\":[\"9g2tcjhhi45T1757454652205\"],\"g81idlyq8zT1757454317697\":[\"notrvqzwy9T1757454505661\",\"jgrdmq2vgfT1757454506525\",\"g7gliaewevT1757454507355\",\"mrzqw5oog5nT1757454507985\",\"po5lfjcx6nnT1757454509292\"],\"jgrdmq2vgfT1757454506525\":[\"laqa2z4c0p8T1757454612630\"],\"laqa2z4c0p8T1757454612630\":[\"3xsgaehhl0cT1757454626150\",\"zxsqs00gzhT1757454641406\"],\"lv58sijkowT1757454518475\":[],\"mrzqw5oog5nT1757454507985\":[],\"notrvqzwy9T1757454505661\":[\"lv58sijkowT1757454518475\",\"pjlasjjr4hT1757454531328\"],\"pjlasjjr4hT1757454531328\":[\"53hupyo2ancT1757454543574\"],\"po5lfjcx6nnT1757454509292\":[],\"rslzzylh19T1757454659676\":[\"uzlgmhowlajT1757454668523\"],\"uzlgmhowlajT1757454668523\":[],\"zxsqs00gzhT1757454641406\":[]},\"contents\":{\"3xsgaehhl0cT1757454626150\":{\"option\":\"【你不喜欢聊天吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不会哦，我经常和女孩子们聊天。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不管是讨论新的小说情节，还是谁跟谁互相暗恋…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e只要在恰当的时机接一句「原来如此」、「竟然是这样」、「然后呢」…就可以顺利推进对话。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…省力节能，我很推荐。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"53hupyo2ancT1757454543574\":{\"option\":\"【好微妙的评价…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…以琳妮特标准，这已经是最高评价了哦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"9g2tcjhhi45T1757454652205\":{\"option\":\"【…除了发呆？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…排除这个选项，一下子还真想不到能做什么。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e要来一杯茶吗？我去给你泡。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"g7gliaewevT1757454507355\":{\"option\":\"【有什么想做的吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e……\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"g81idlyq8zT1757454317697\":{\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e……\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…待机模式结束。抱歉，响应需要一点时间，并非不想理你。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"jgrdmq2vgfT1757454506525\":{\"option\":\"【想一起聊聊天吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e……\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"laqa2z4c0p8T1757454612630\":{\"option\":\"【……】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…真罕见，很少会有人想让我先开启一个话题。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e毕竟大部分情况下，都会像这样陷入沉默。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"lv58sijkowT1757454518475\":{\"option\":\"【以正常标准而言？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e清洁的空气，温暖的床榻，广阔的空间…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e要是我们以前能在这种环境下长大，林尼也不用总操心这操心那了吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…好像掺进了一点主观要素，请不要在意。总之是一个好地方。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"mrzqw5oog5nT1757454507985\":{\"option\":\"【早啊，琳妮特。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e早上好，旅行者。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e早上很好，新的一天刚开始，有充足的时间，可以用来休息。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…你要一起来吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"notrvqzwy9T1757454505661\":{\"option\":\"【在这里还习惯吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e只要把自己的意识放空，在哪里都一样。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…不过，以正常标准而言，这里的环境确实很不错。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"pjlasjjr4hT1757454531328\":{\"option\":\"【以你的标准呢？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e很适合发呆。充能速率比平时高了百分之五。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"po5lfjcx6nnT1757454509292\":{\"option\":\"【晚安，琳妮特。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e晚安，旅行者。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…进入待机模式…呼，呼…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"rslzzylh19T1757454659676\":{\"option\":\"【主人怎么能麻烦客人泡茶呢。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不麻烦的，对我来说，泡茶是件让人心情愉悦的事。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e每次有客人上门找林尼会谈，都是由我来泡茶招待。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e甄选茶叶，触量水温，观察气旋…我很喜欢这个过程。为了一杯完美的茶，投入百分百的精神。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"uzlgmhowlajT1757454668523\":{\"option\":\"【 居然有这么多门道…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…在泡茶的时候，不会有人把我拉去问话。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e泡完之后，只要举着杯子坐在一边，也可以制造出正在喝茶、没空说话的氛围。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e结果还是为了发呆吗！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e玩笑而已——很意外吗？我也是会开玩笑的，只是平时没有必要。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e泡茶的确是我少有的爱好之一，品茶也是。即使只有细微味道的不同，我也能加以区分。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你见多识广，应该尝过不少地方的茶吧？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e有空的话，要来尝一下我的手艺吗？我也想听听你的评价。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"zxsqs00gzhT1757454641406\":{\"option\":\"【毕竟不太说话呢…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e要想说出一句话，得先倾听，再分析，构思完毕，最后讲出口。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e如果想你一句我一句地聊起天的话，就得高效处理这些情报…唔，有点费力。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…不过也有一些人，本就希望聊天的对象多听、少说吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e如果你有什么想倾诉的事，可以来找我。在帮忙平复心情方面，我还是有点经验的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e而且，完全不用担心我会到处乱说。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"8227","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/10/83684823/271201dc704d632c1342d833f810c9de_722911711411151341.p